  lastReport: 'READY FOR GFSX_BRAIN_FIXED PHYSICAL LIVE INFERENCE.

    WARNINGS:

    -
    The robot has no wheel encoders or IMU; observations 10-13 use motor-PWM dead
    reckoning rather than measured world pose.

    - The supplied 15,008,000-step
    Fixed model recorded zero catches and never observed holding=1. Treat it as an
    experimental search/drive policy, not a validated grasp policy.

    - Every
    Play session starts disarmed. F6 arms fixed S1-S3/S6, F8 arms S5, F7 arms S4,
    and F9 arms tracks; each requires two presses. F10/Backspace stops everything.'
  readyForFixedLiveInference: 1
